        "kind": "html",
        "table": null,
        "pk": null,
        "html": "<div class=\"fin-dashboard\">\n<div class=\"fin-d-title\"><h1>MIS & Management Reporting / تقارير الإدارة</h1><p>Portfolio, subsidy, delinquency and Fund reporting views</p></div>\n<div class=\"fin-kpi-grid\">\n<div class=\"fin-kpi\"><div class=\"fin-kpi-head\"><div class=\"fin-kpi-icon\"><span class=\"fa fa-bank\"></span></div><div><div class=\"fin-kpi-value\">&P140_LOANS.</div><div class=\"fin-kpi-label\">Loans / التمويلات</div></div></div><div class=\"fin-kpi-delta\">Current portfolio</div></div>\n<div class=\"fin-kpi\"><div class=\"fin-kpi-head\"><div class=\"fin-kpi-icon\"><span class=\"fa fa-money\"></span></div><div><div class=\"fin-kpi-value\">&P140_OUTSTANDING.</div><div class=\"fin-kpi-label\">Outstanding / الرصيد</div></div></div><div class=\"fin-kpi-delta\">EGP</div></div>\n<div class=\"fin-kpi\"><div class=\"fin-kpi-head\"><div class=\"fin-kpi-icon\"><span class=\"fa fa-gift\"></span></div><div><div class=\"fin-kpi-value\">&P140_SUBSIDY.</div><div class=\"fin-kpi-label\">Subsidy / الدعم</div></div></div><div class=\"fin-kpi-delta\">Approved/paid</div></div>\n<div class=\"fin-kpi alert\"><div class=\"fin-kpi-head\"><div class=\"fin-kpi-icon\"><span class=\"fa fa-warning\"></span></div><div><div class=\"fin-kpi-value\">&P140_DQ.</div><div class=\"fin-kpi-label\">Delinquent / متعثر</div></div></div><div class=\"fin-kpi-delta\">Open cases</div></div>\n<div class=\"fin-kpi\"><div class=\"fin-kpi-head\"><div class=\"fin-kpi-icon\"><span class=\"fa fa-file-text-o\"></span></div><div><div class=\"fin-kpi-value\">&P140_FUND_EVENTS.</div><div class=\"fin-kpi-label\">Fund Report Events / أحداث التقرير</div></div></div><div class=\"fin-kpi-delta\">Monthly reporting feed</div></div>\n<div class=\"fin-kpi focus\"><div class=\"fin-kpi-head\"><div class=\"fin-kpi-icon\"><span class=\"fa fa-percent\"></span></div><div><div class=\"fin-kpi-value\">&P140_DQ_RATE.</div><div class=\"fin-kpi-label\">Delinquency Rate / معدل التعثر</div></div></div><div class=\"fin-kpi-delta\">%</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"fin-grid-2\">\n<div class=\"fin-card\"><div class=\"fin-card-header\">Operational Reports</div><div class=\"fin-card-body\"><p><a class=\"fin-card-link\" href=\"/mortgage-finance/p20\">Application Pipeline / دورة الطلبات</a></p><p><a class=\"fin-card-link\" href=\"/mortgage-finance/p120\">Installments Due / الأقساط المستحقة</a></p><p><a class=\"fin-card-link\" href=\"/mortgage-finance/p130\">Delinquency / التعثر</a></p></div></div>\n<div class=\"fin-card\"><div class=\"fin-card-header\">MIS & Fund Reports</div><div class=\"fin-card-body\"><p><a class=\"fin-card-link\" href=\"/mortgage-finance/p141\">Fund Monthly Report</a></p><p><a class=\"fin-card-link\" href=\"/mortgage-finance/p142\">Portfolio Summary</a></p><p><a class=\"fin-card-link\" href=\"/mortgage-finance/p143\">Delinquency MIS</a></p><p><a class=\"fin-card-link\" href=\"/mortgage-finance/p144\">Origination Funnel</a></p><p><a class=\"fin-card-link\" href=\"/mortgage-finance/p145\">Turnaround Time</a></p><p><a class=\"fin-card-link\" href=\"/mortgage-finance/p146\">Subsidy MIS</a></p><p><a class=\"fin-card-link\" href=\"/mortgage-finance/p147\">Geography MIS</a></p></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>",
